ough the following points:<br>\n<ul>\n<li>(0 comma negative 6)</li>\n<li>(1 comma negative 5 and one sixth)</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul></div></figure></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">What is the <em>y</em>-intercept of the graph shown?</p>","externalid":"d359151d-6c08-4338-b308-8a73c712373f","templateid":"3db09b94-8cfb-4a6b-a5da-4ebe0bc0b43d","vaultid":"155c5260-0637-440b-b2bd-6ceb8299e2f8","type":"mcq","answerOptions":[{"id":"a1842950-4e3f-491c-bdab-181d486fea67","content":"<p><math alttext=\"left parenthesis 0 comma negative 6 right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mrow></mfenced></math></p>"},{"id":"81f5f74e-debf-4941-b90e-2c92bced75f7","content":"<p><math alttext=\"left parenthesis negative 6 comma 0 right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p>"},{"id":"4a1bb458-863a-435f-bffd-087d1ab7dd77","content":"<p><math alttext=\"left parenthesis 0 comma 0 right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p>"},{"id":"590c45b2-43ad-4286-a07d-9fc53a4b9d4e","content":"<p><math alttext=\"left parenthesis negative 5 comma negative 5 right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mrow></mfenced></math></p>"}],"correct_answer":["A"]},"createDate":1691007959827,"updateDate":1691007959827}$SATQ$::jsonb, 1691007959827, 1691007959827),
