    ($SATQ$72ae8a87$SATQ$, $SATQ$d38233c5-51bc-4d5b-b405-07bfe9387efc$SATQ$::uuid, $SATQ$a874510a-db01-4435-951c-b6d482b71498$SATQ$::uuid, NULL, $SATQ$qbank$SATQ$, $SATQ$SAT$SATQ$, 2, $SATQ$Math$SATQ$, $SATQ$Advanced Math$SATQ$, $SATQ$P$SATQ$, $SATQ$P.C.$SATQ$, $SATQ$Nonlinear functions$SATQ$, $SATQ$E$SATQ$, 3, $SATQ$mcq$SATQ$, NULL, $SATQ$<p style="text-align: left;">The function <math alttext="f left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals 200,000 left parenthesis 1.21 right parenthesis Superscript x"><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>200,000</mn><msup><mfenced><mn>1.21</mn></mfenced><mi>x</mi></msup></math> gives a company&rsquo;s predicted annual revenue, in dollars, <math alttext="x"><mi>x</mi>
