" src="https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/75915e3c/img_008_2d95c368.png" alt="f of 2 equals 18"></span>. Therefore, the value of <span class="math-container"><img align="middle" role="math" class="math-img" src="https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/75915e3c/img_009_be9885a7.png" alt="f of 2 "></span> is 18.<p>Choice A is incorrect and may result from evaluating the expression as <span class="math-container"><img align="middle" role="math" class="math-img" src="https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/75915e3c/img_010_5ad86367.png" alt="3 squared"></span>. Choice B is incorrect and may result from evaluating the expression as <span class="math-container"><img align="middle" role="math" class="math-img" src="https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/75915e3c/img_011_027bff31.png" alt="2 times, open parenthesis, 3 times 2, close parenthesis"></span>. Choice D is incorrect and may result from evaluating the expression as <span class="math-container"><img align="middle" role="math" class="math-img" src="https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/75915e3c/img_012_ae9b9f5a.png" alt="open parenthesis, 2 times 3, close parenthesis, squared"></span>.</p><p>&nbsp;</p></p>
