://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/75915e3c/img_003_5d515730.png\" alt=\"2 times 3 raised to the x power\"></span> when <span class=\"math-container\"><img align=\"middle\" role=\"math\" class=\"math-img\" src=\"https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/75915e3c/img_004_4a24f52d.png\" alt=\"x equals 2\"></span>. Substituting 2 for <span class=\"italic\">x</span> in the given equation yields <span class=\"math-container\"><img align=\"middle\" role=\"math\" class=\"math-img\" src=\"https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/75915e3c/img_005_c2bc2930.png\" alt=\"f of 2 equals, 2 times, 3 squared\"></span>. Simplifying <span class=\"math-container\"><img align=\"middle\" role=\"math\" class=\"math-img\" src=\"https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/75915e3c/img_006_16602c34.png\" alt=\"3 squared \"></span> in the equation results in <span class=\"math-container\"><img align=\"middle\" role=\"math\" class=\"math-img\" src=\"https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/75915e3c/img_007_4def2d46.png\" alt=\"f of 2 equals, 2 times 9\"></span>. Evaluating the right-hand side of the equation yields <span class=\"math-container\"><img align=\"middle\" role=\"math\" class=\"math-img\" src=\"https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/75915e3c/img_008_2d95c368.png\" alt=\"f of 2 equals 18\"></span>. Therefore, the value of <span class=\"math-container\"><img align=\"middle\" role=\"math\" class=\"math-img\" src=\"https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/75915e3c/img_009_be9885a7.png\" alt=\"f of 2 \"></span> is 18.<p>Choice A is incorrect and may result from evaluating the expression as <span class=\"math-container\"><img align=\"middle\" role=\"math\" class=\"math-img\" src=\"https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/75915e3c/img_010_5ad86367.png\" alt=\"3 squared\"></span>. Choice B is incorrect and may result from evaluating the expression as <span class=\"math-container\"><img align=\"middle\" role=\"math\" class=\"math-img\" src=\"https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/75915e3c/img_011_027bff31.png\" alt=\"2 times, open parenthesis, 3 times 2, close parenthesis\"></span>. Choice D is incorrect and may result from evaluating the expression as <span class=\"math-container\"><img align=\"middle\" role=\"math\" class=\"math-img\" src=\"https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/75915e3c/img_012_ae9b9f5a.png\" alt=\"open parenthesis, 2 times 3, close parenthesis, squared\"></span>.</p><p>&nbsp;</p></p>\n","answer_style":"Multiple Choice","section":"Math","image_count":13,"raw_list":{"updateDate":1691007959627,"pPcc":"SAT#P","questionId":"75915e3c","skill_cd":"P.C.","score_band_range_cd":2,"skill_desc":"Nonlinear functions","createDate":1691007959627,"program":"SAT","primary_class_cd_desc":"Advanced Math","ibn":"032723-DC","external_id":null,"primary_class_cd":"P","uId":"740a6886-7296-4cdf-8ca5-d250bc3569c8","difficulty":"E"},"raw_detail":{"item_id":"032723-DC","section":"Math","body":"<div class=\"stimulus_reference \" xmlns=\"http://www.imsglobal.org/xsd/apip/apipv1p0/qtiitem/imsqti_v2p1\"><p class=\"standalone_statement style:1 \"><span class=\"math_expression \"><span class=\"math-container\"><img align=\"middle\" role=\"math\" class=\"math-img\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"f of x equals, 2 times, open parenthesis, 3 raised to the x power, close parenthesis\"></span></span></p></div>\n","prompt":"<p class=\"stem_paragraph \">For the function <span class=\"italic\">f</span> defined above, what is the value of <span class=\"math-container\"><img align=\"middle\" role=\"math\" class=\"math-img\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"f of 2\"></span>?</p>\n","answer":{"style":"Multiple Choice","choices":{"a":{"body":"<p class=\"choice_paragraph \">9</p>\n"},"b":{"body":"<p class=\"choice_paragraph \">12</p>\n"},"c":{"body":"<p class=\"choice_paragraph \">18</p>\n"},"d":{"body":"<p class=\"choice_paragraph \">36</p>\n"}},"correct_choice":"c","rationale":"<p>Choice C is correct. The value of <span class=\"math-container\"><img align=\"middle\" role=\"math\" class=\"math-img\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"f of 2 \"></span> is found by evaluating the expression <span class=\"math-container\"><img align=\"middle\" role=\"math\" class=\"math-img\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"2 times 3 raised to the x power\"></span> when <span class=\"math-container\"><img align=\"middle\" role=\"math\" class=\"math-img\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"x equals 2\"></span>. Substituting 2 for <span class=\"italic\">x</span> in the given equation yields <span class=\"math-container\"><img align=\"middle\" role=\"math\" class=\"math-img\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"f of 2 equals, 2 times, 3 squared\"></span>. Simplifying <span class=\"math-container\"><img align=\"middle\" role=\"math\" class=\"math-img\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"3 squared \"></span> in the equation results in <span class=\"math-container\"><img align=\"middle\" role=\"math\" class=\"math-img\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"f of 2 equals, 2 times 9\"></span>. Evaluating the right-hand side of the equation yields <span class=\"math-container\"><img align=\"middle\" role=\"math\" class=\"math-img\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"f of 2 equals 18\"></span>. Therefore, the value of <span class=\"math-container\"><img align=\"middle\" role=\"math\" class=\"math-img\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"f of 2 \"></span> is 18.<p>Choice A is incorrect and may result from evaluating the expression as <span class=\"math-container\"><img align=\"middle\" role=\"math\" class=\"math-img\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"3 squared\"></span>. Choice B is incorrect and may result from evaluating the expression as <span class=\"math-container\"><img align=\"middle\" role=\"math\" class=\"math-img\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"2 times, open parenthesis, 3 times 2, close parenthesis\"></span>. Choice D is incorrect and may result from evaluating the expression as <span class=\"math-container\"><img align=\"middle\" role=\"math\" class=\"math-img\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"open parenthesis, 2 times 3, close parenthesis, squared\"></span>.</p><p>&nbsp;</p></p>\n"}},"createDate":1691007959627,"updateDate":1691007959627}$SATQ$::jsonb, 1691007959627, 1691007959627),
