<p style="text-align: left;">Choice C is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>$SATQ$, false, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, $SATQ${"questionId":"781c2f6e","external_id":"ace58eff-0b88-4468-aeb9-2f5ff6974cd4","disclosed_item_id":null,"source":"qbank","vaultid":null,"uId":"0f1b4431-34a2-41df-a582-80b2f313e460","program":"SAT","test_type":2,"test_type_desc":"Math","primary_class_cd":"P","domain":"Advanced Math","skill_cd":"P.C.","skill_desc":"Nonlinear functions","difficulty":"H","score_band_range_cd":7,"type":"mcq","stimulus":null,"stem":"<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The function <math alttext=\"f\"><mi>f</mi>\n</math> is&nbsp;defined by&nbsp;<math alttext=\"f left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals a left parenthesis 2.2 Superscript x Baseline plus 2.2 Superscript b Baseline right parenthesis\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mfenced><mrow><msup><mn>2.2</mn><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>2.2</mn><mi>b</mi></msup></mrow></mfenced></math>, where <math alttext=\"a\"><mi>a</mi>\n</math> and <math alttext=\"b\"><mi>b</mi>\n</math> are integer constants and <math alttext=\"0 less than a less than b\"><mn>0</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>b</mi></math>. The functions <math alttext=\"g\"><mi>g</mi>\n</math> and <math alttext=\"h\"><mi>h</mi>\n</math> are equivalent to function <math alttext=\"f\"><mi>f</mi>\n</math>, where <math alttext=\"k\"><mi>k</mi>\n</math> and <math alttext=\"m\"><mi>m</mi>\n</math> are constants. Which of the following equations displays the <em>y</em>-coordinate of the <em>y</em>-intercept of the graph of <math alttext=\"y equals f left parenthesis x right parenthesis\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> in the <em>xy</em>-plane as a constant or coefficient?</p>\n<ol style=\"list-style-type: upper-roman;\">\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\"><math alttext=\"g left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals a left parenthesis 2.2 Superscript x Baseline plus k right parenthesis\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mfenced><mrow><msup><mn>2.2</mn><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\"><math alttext=\"h left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals a left parenthesis 2.2 right parenthesis Superscript x Baseline plus m\"><mi>h</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mfenced><mn>2.2</mn></mfenced><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>m</mi></math>&nbsp;</li>\n</ol>","answerOptions":[{"id":"90e8bee8-aa8d-4a40-9ffc-2da246ef989d","content":"<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span data-ssml-say-as=\"characters\">I</span> only</p>"},{"id":"da962fb5-1e70-4118-a299-5bf6cb30d900","content":"<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span data-ssml-say-as=\"characters\">II</span> only</p>"},{"id":"451e6699-b1ed-46e0-8f09-1159ac95decf","content":"<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span data-ssml-say-as=\"characters\">I</span> and <span data-ssml-say-as=\"characters\">II</span></p>"},{"id":"8c1f75a1-1859-49a1-a35c-a6c55788a65a","content":"<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Neither <span data-ssml-say-as=\"characters\">I</span> nor <span data-ssml-say-as=\"characters\">II</span></p>"}],"keys":["8c1f75a1-1859-49a1-a35c-a6c55788a65a"],"correct_answer":["D"],"rationale":"<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice D is correct. A <em>y</em>-intercept of a graph in the <em>xy</em>-plane is a point where the graph intersects the <em>y</em>-axis, or a point where <math alttext=\"x equals 0\"><mrow>\n<mi>x</mi>\n<mo>=</mo>\n<mn>0</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math>. Substituting <math alttext=\"0\"><mn>0</mn>\n</math> for <math alttext=\"x\"><mi>x</mi>\n</math> in the equation defining function <math alttext=\"f\"><mi>f</mi>\n</math> yields <math alttext=\"f left parenthesis 0 right parenthesis equals a left parenthesis 2.2 Superscript 0 Baseline plus 2.2 Superscript b Baseline right parenthesis\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mfenced><mrow><msup><mn>2.2</mn><mn>0</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>2.2</mn><mi>b</mi></msup></mrow></mfenced></math>, or&nbsp;<math alttext=\"f left parenthesis 0 right parenthesis equals a left parenthesis 1 plus 2.2 Superscript b Baseline right parenthesis\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>2.2</mn><mi>b</mi></msup></mrow></mfenced></math>. So, the <em>y</em>-coordinate of the <em>y</em>-intercept of the graph is&nbsp;<math alttext=\"a left parenthesis 1 plus 2.2 Superscript b Baseline right parenthesis\"><mi>a</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>2.2</mn><mi>b</mi></msup></mrow></mfenced></math>, or equivalently,&nbsp;<math alttext=\"a plus a left parenthesis 2.2 right parenthesis Superscript b\"><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mfenced><mn>2.2</mn></mfenced><mi>b</mi></msup></math>. It's given that function <math alttext=\"g\"><mi>g</mi>\n</math> is equivalent to function <math alttext=\"f\"><mi>f</mi>\n</math>, where <math alttext=\"0 less than a less than b\"><mn>0</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>b</mi></math>. It follows that <math alttext=\"k equals 2.2 Superscript b\"><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2.2</mn><mi>b</mi></msup></math>. Since&nbsp;<math alttext=\"a left parenthesis 2.2 right parenthesis Superscript b\"><mi>a</mi><msup><mfenced><mn>2.2</mn></mfenced><mi>b</mi></msup></math> can't be equal to <math alttext=\"0\"><mn>0</mn>\n</math>, the coefficient <math alttext=\"a\"><mi>a</mi>\n</math> can't be equal to&nbsp;<math alttext=\"a plus a left parenthesis 2.2 right parenthesis Superscript b\"><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mfenced><mn>2.2</mn></mfenced><mi>b</mi></msup></math>. Since&nbsp;<math alttext=\"0 less than a\"><mn>0</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>a</mi></math>, the constant <math alttext=\"k\"><mi>k</mi>\n</math>, which is equal to&nbsp;<math alttext=\"2.2 Superscript b\"><msup><mn>2.2</mn><mi>b</mi></msup></math>, can't be equal to&nbsp;<math alttext=\"a plus a left parenthesis 2.2 right parenthesis Superscript b\"><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mfenced><mn>2.2</mn></mfenced><mi>b</mi></msup></math>. Therefore, function <math alttext=\"g\"><mi>g</mi>\n</math> doesn't display the <em>y</em>-coordinate of the <em>y</em>-intercept of the graph of&nbsp;<math alttext=\"y equals f left parenthesis x right parenthesis\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> in the <em>xy</em>-plane as a constant or coefficient. It's also given that function <math alttext=\"h\"><mi>h</mi>\n</math> is equivalent to function <math alttext=\"f\"><mi>f</mi>\n</math>, where&nbsp;<math alttext=\"0 less than a less than b\"><mn>0</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>b</mi></math>. The equation defining <math alttext=\"f\"><mi>f</mi>\n</math> can be rewritten as&nbsp;<math alttext=\"f left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals a left parenthesis 2.2 right parenthesis Superscript x Baseline plus a left parenthesis 2.2 right parenthesis Superscript b\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mfenced><mn>2.2</mn></mfenced><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mfenced><mn>2.2</mn></mfenced><mi>b</mi></msup></math>. It follows that&nbsp;<math alttext=\"m equals a left parenthesis 2.2 right parenthesis Superscript b\"><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mfenced><mn>2.2</mn></mfenced><mi>b</mi></msup></math>. Since&nbsp;<math alttext=\"a left parenthesis 2.2 right parenthesis Superscript b\"><mi>a</mi><msup><mfenced><mn>2.2</mn></mfenced><mi>b</mi></msup></math> can't be equal to <math alttext=\"0\"><mn>0</mn>\n</math>, the coefficient <math alttext=\"a\"><mi>a</mi>\n</math> can't be equal to&nbsp;<math alttext=\"a plus a left parenthesis 2.2 right parenthesis Superscript b\"><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mfenced><mn>2.2</mn></mfenced><mi>b</mi></msup></math>. Since <math alttext=\"0 less than a\"><mn>0</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>a</mi></math>, the constant <math alttext=\"m\"><mi>m</mi>\n</math>, which is equal to <math alttext=\"a left parenthesis 2.2 right parenthesis Superscript b\"><mi>a</mi><msup><mfenced><mn>2.2</mn></mfenced><mi>b</mi></msup></math>, can't be equal to <math alttext=\"a plus a left parenthesis 2.2 right parenthesis Superscript b\"><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mfenced><mn>2.2</mn></mfenced><mi>b</mi></msup></math>. Therefore, function <math alttext=\"h\"><mi>h</mi>\n</math> doesn't display the <em>y</em>-coordinate of the <em>y</em>-intercept of the graph of&nbsp;<math alttext=\"y equals f left parenthesis x right parenthesis\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> in the <em>xy</em>-plane as a constant or coefficient. Thus, neither function <math alttext=\"g\"><mi>g</mi>\n</math> nor function <math alttext=\"h\"><mi>h</mi>\n</math> displays the <em>y</em>-coordinate of the <em>y</em>-intercept of the graph of&nbsp;<math alttext=\"y equals f left parenthesis x right parenthesis\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> in the <em>xy</em>-plane as a constant or coefficient.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice A is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice B is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice C is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>","parenttemplatename":null,"parenttemplateid":null,"templateclusterid":null,"templateclustername":null,"origin":null,"position":null,"image_count":0,"raw_list":{"updateDate":1743430554985,"pPcc":"SAT#P","questionId":"781c2f6e","skill_cd":"P.C.","score_band_range_cd":7,"skill_desc":"Nonlinear functions","createDate":1743430554985,"program":"SAT","primary_class_cd_desc":"Advanced Math","ibn":"","external_id":"ace58eff-0b88-4468-aeb9-2f5ff6974cd4","primary_class_cd":"P","uId":"0f1b4431-34a2-41df-a582-80b2f313e460","difficulty":"H"},"raw_detail":{"type":"mcq","stem":"<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The function <math alttext=\"f\"><mi>f</mi>\n</math> is&nbsp;defined by&nbsp;<math alttext=\"f left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals a left parenthesis 2.2 Superscript x Baseline plus 2.2 Superscript b Baseline right parenthesis\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mfenced><mrow><msup><mn>2.2</mn><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>2.2</mn><mi>b</mi></msup></mrow></mfenced></math>, where <math alttext=\"a\"><mi>a</mi>\n</math> and <math alttext=\"b\"><mi>b</mi>\n</math> are integer constants and <math alttext=\"0 less than a less than b\"><mn>0</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>b</mi></math>. The functions <math alttext=\"g\"><mi>g</mi>\n</math> and <math alttext=\"h\"><mi>h</mi>\n</math> are equivalent to function <math alttext=\"f\"><mi>f</mi>\n</math>, where <math alttext=\"k\"><mi>k</mi>\n</math> and <math alttext=\"m\"><mi>m</mi>\n</math> are constants. Which of the following equations displays the <em>y</em>-coordinate of the <em>y</em>-intercept of the graph of <math alttext=\"y equals f left parenthesis x right parenthesis\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> in the <em>xy</em>-plane as a constant or coefficient?</p>\n<ol style=\"list-style-type: upper-roman;\">\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\"><math alttext=\"g left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals a left parenthesis 2.2 Superscript x Baseline plus k right parenthesis\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mfenced><mrow><msup><mn>2.2</mn><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\"><math alttext=\"h left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals a left parenthesis 2.2 right parenthesis Superscript x Baseline plus m\"><mi>h</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mfenced><mn>2.2</mn></mfenced><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>m</mi></math>&nbsp;</li>\n</ol>","keys":["8c1f75a1-1859-49a1-a35c-a6c55788a65a"],"answerOptions":[{"id":"90e8bee8-aa8d-4a40-9ffc-2da246ef989d","content":"<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span data-ssml-say-as=\"characters\">I</span> only</p>"},{"id":"da962fb5-1e70-4118-a299-5bf6cb30d900","content":"<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span data-ssml-say-as=\"characters\">II</span> only</p>"},{"id":"451e6699-b1ed-46e0-8f09-1159ac95decf","content":"<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span data-ssml-say-as=\"characters\">I</span> and <span data-ssml-say-as=\"characters\">II</span></p>"},{"id":"8c1f75a1-1859-49a1-a35c-a6c55788a65a","content":"<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Neither <span data-ssml-say-as=\"characters\">I</span> nor <span data-ssml-say-as=\"characters\">II</span></p>"}],"rationale":"<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice D is correct. A <em>y</em>-intercept of a graph in the <em>xy</em>-plane is a point where the graph intersects the <em>y</em>-axis, or a point where <math alttext=\"x equals 0\"><mrow>\n<mi>x</mi>\n<mo>=</mo>\n<mn>0</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math>. Substituting <math alttext=\"0\"><mn>0</mn>\n</math> for <math alttext=\"x\"><mi>x</mi>\n</math> in the equation defining function <math alttext=\"f\"><mi>f</mi>\n</math> yields <math alttext=\"f left parenthesis 0 right parenthesis equals a left parenthesis 2.2 Superscript 0 Baseline plus 2.2 Superscript b Baseline right parenthesis\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mfenced><mrow><msup><mn>2.2</mn><mn>0</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>2.2</mn><mi>b</mi></msup></mrow></mfenced></math>, or&nbsp;<math alttext=\"f left parenthesis 0 right parenthesis equals a left parenthesis 1 plus 2.2 Superscript b Baseline right parenthesis\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>2.2</mn><mi>b</mi></msup></mrow></mfenced></math>. So, the <em>y</em>-coordinate of the <em>y</em>-intercept of the graph is&nbsp;<math alttext=\"a left parenthesis 1 plus 2.2 Superscript b Baseline right parenthesis\"><mi>a</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>2.2</mn><mi>b</mi></msup></mrow></mfenced></math>, or equivalently,&nbsp;<math alttext=\"a plus a left parenthesis 2.2 right parenthesis Superscript b\"><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mfenced><mn>2.2</mn></mfenced><mi>b</mi></msup></math>. It's given that function <math alttext=\"g\"><mi>g</mi>\n</math> is equivalent to function <math alttext=\"f\"><mi>f</mi>\n</math>, where <math alttext=\"0 less than a less than b\"><mn>0</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>b</mi></math>. It follows that <math alttext=\"k equals 2.2 Superscript b\"><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2.2</mn><mi>b</mi></msup></math>. Since&nbsp;<math alttext=\"a left parenthesis 2.2 right parenthesis Superscript b\"><mi>a</mi><msup><mfenced><mn>2.2</mn></mfenced><mi>b</mi></msup></math> can't be equal to <math alttext=\"0\"><mn>0</mn>\n</math>, the coefficient <math alttext=\"a\"><mi>a</mi>\n</math> can't be equal to&nbsp;<math alttext=\"a plus a left parenthesis 2.2 right parenthesis Superscript b\"><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mfenced><mn>2.2</mn></mfenced><mi>b</mi></msup></math>. Since&nbsp;<math alttext=\"0 less than a\"><mn>0</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>a</mi></math>, the constant <math alttext=\"k\"><mi>k</mi>\n</math>, which is equal to&nbsp;<math alttext=\"2.2 Superscript b\"><msup><mn>2.2</mn><mi>b</mi></msup></math>, can't be equal to&nbsp;<math alttext=\"a plus a left parenthesis 2.2 right parenthesis Superscript b\"><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mfenced><mn>2.2</mn></mfenced><mi>b</mi></msup></math>. Therefore, function <math alttext=\"g\"><mi>g</mi>\n</math> doesn't display the <em>y</em>-coordinate of the <em>y</em>-intercept of the graph of&nbsp;<math alttext=\"y equals f left parenthesis x right parenthesis\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> in the <em>xy</em>-plane as a constant or coefficient. It's also given that function <math alttext=\"h\"><mi>h</mi>\n</math> is equivalent to function <math alttext=\"f\"><mi>f</mi>\n</math>, where&nbsp;<math alttext=\"0 less than a less than b\"><mn>0</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>b</mi></math>. The equation defining <math alttext=\"f\"><mi>f</mi>\n</math> can be rewritten as&nbsp;<math alttext=\"f left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals a left parenthesis 2.2 right parenthesis Superscript x Baseline plus a left parenthesis 2.2 right parenthesis Superscript b\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mfenced><mn>2.2</mn></mfenced><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mfenced><mn>2.2</mn></mfenced><mi>b</mi></msup></math>. It follows that&nbsp;<math alttext=\"m equals a left parenthesis 2.2 right parenthesis Superscript b\"><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mfenced><mn>2.2</mn></mfenced><mi>b</mi></msup></math>. Since&nbsp;<math alttext=\"a left parenthesis 2.2 right parenthesis Superscript b\"><mi>a</mi><msup><mfenced><mn>2.2</mn></mfenced><mi>b</mi></msup></math> can't be equal to <math alttext=\"0\"><mn>0</mn>\n</math>, the coefficient <math alttext=\"a\"><mi>a</mi>\n</math> can't be equal to&nbsp;<math alttext=\"a plus a left parenthesis 2.2 right parenthesis Superscript b\"><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mfenced><mn>2.2</mn></mfenced><mi>b</mi></msup></math>. Since <math alttext=\"0 less than a\"><mn>0</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>a</mi></math>, the constant <math alttext=\"m\"><mi>m</mi>\n</math>, which is equal to <math alttext=\"a left parenthesis 2.2 right parenthesis Superscript b\"><mi>a</mi><msup><mfenced><mn>2.2</mn></mfenced><mi>b</mi></msup></math>, can't be equal to <math alttext=\"a plus a left parenthesis 2.2 right parenthesis Superscript b\"><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mfenced><mn>2.2</mn></mfenced><mi>b</mi></msup></math>. Therefore, function <math alttext=\"h\"><mi>h</mi>\n</math> doesn't display the <em>y</em>-coordinate of the <em>y</em>-intercept of the graph of&nbsp;<math alttext=\"y equals f left parenthesis x right parenthesis\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> in the <em>xy</em>-plane as a constant or coefficient. Thus, neither function <math alttext=\"g\"><mi>g</mi>\n</math> nor function <math alttext=\"h\"><mi>h</mi>\n</math> displays the <em>y</em>-coordinate of the <em>y</em>-intercept of the graph of&nbsp;<math alttext=\"y equals f left parenthesis x right parenthesis\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> in the <em>xy</em>-plane as a constant or coefficient.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice A is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice B is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice C is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>","externalid":"ace58eff-0b88-4468-aeb9-2f5ff6974cd4","correct_answer":["D"]},"createDate":1743430554985,"updateDate":1743430554985}$SATQ$::jsonb, 1743430554985, 1743430554985),
