<div role="region" aria-label="Long description for graph of a parabola" class="sr-only"><ul><li>The parabola opens upward.</li><li>The parabola passes through the following points:<br><ul><li>(negative 1 comma 5)</li><li>(0 comma 2)</li><li>(1 comma 5)</li></ul></li></ul></div></figure></p>
<p style="text-align: left;">The graph of the quadratic function <math alttext="y equals f left parenthesis x right parenthesis"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> is shown. What is the vertex of the graph?</p>$SATQ$, $SATQ$[{"id":"8fa9dfd5-66c4-494d-9ef2-8753e32d1a58","content":"<p><math alttext=\"left parenthesis 0 comma negative 2 right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mrow></mfenced></math></p>"},{"id":"01069562-bc04-4cc5-ae01-e91668f6ae34","content":"<p><math alttext=\"left parenthesis 0 comma negative 3 right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mrow></mfenced></math></p>"},{"id":"03060942-7383-4d5c-9f11-4dda57ef5944","content":"<p><math alttext=\"left parenthesis 0 comma 2 right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mrow></mfenced></math></p>"},{"id":"6bade1dd-2072-499d-924c-acc9b09aaaa6","content":"<p><math alttext=\"left parenthesis 0 comma 3 right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mrow></mfenced></math></p>"}]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$["C"]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$["03060942-7383-4d5c-9f11-4dda57ef5944"]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$<p style="text-align: left;">Choice C is correct. The vertex of the graph of a quadratic function in the <em>xy</em>-plane is the point at which the graph is either at its minimum or maximum <em>y</em>-value. In the graph shown, the minimum <em>y</em>-value occurs at the point <math alttext="left parenthesis 0 comma 2 right parenthesis"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>.</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">Choice A is incorrect. The graph shown doesn't pass through the point <math alttext="left parenthesis 0 comma negative 2 right parenthesis"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>.</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">Choice B is incorrect. The graph shown doesn't pass through the point <math alttext="left parenthesis 0 comma negative 3 right parenthesis"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>.</p>
