	<mi>a</mi>
</mrow>
</math> to both sides of this equation yields <math alttext="3.24 a equals 51.84"><mn>3.24</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>51.84</mn></math>. Dividing both sides of this equation by <math alttext="3.24"><mn>3.24</mn>
